sequenceDiagram
  actor R as Requester
  participant B as Broker
  participant A as Approver (Slack / Email)
  participant S as Resource
  R->>B: 1. request access (with justification)
  B->>B: 2. policy check: on-call? incident? in window?
  opt request needs human approval
    B->>A: 3. approval request, in Slack or email
    A-->>B: 4. approve / deny
  end
  B-->>R: 5. short-lived, scoped credential
  Note over B: every grant logged
  R->>S: 6. access, within the window
  Note over R,S: session recorded
  B--xR: 7. credential expires
  Note over R,S: no standing door remains
